msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Copiado"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:533
msgid "Spotify is being slow on the shared app."
msgstr "Spotify va lento con la app compartida."

#: src/ui/mod.rs:536
msgid ""
"Spotifast no longer offers the shared app, and Spotify can stop accepting it "
"at any time. Set up your own free Spotify app and you won't have to wait."
msgstr ""
"Spotifast ya no ofrece la app compartida y Spotify puede dejar de aceptarla "
"en cualquier momento. Configura tu propia app gratuita de Spotify y no "
